@base = http://localhost:5200
@customerToken = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_CLIENTE
@workerToken = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_TRABAJADOR
@adminToken = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_ADMIN
@locationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@quoteId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@bookingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/health

### Readiness (PostgreSQL y migraciones)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Registro (usar un correo diferente para cada actor)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"cliente@example.com","password":"UnaClaveFuerte!2026"}

### Login: copiar accessToken; no guardar tokens reales en el repositorio
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"cliente@example.com","password":"UnaClaveFuerte!2026"}

### Perfil cliente
POST {{base}}/api/v1/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Cliente de prueba","role":"Customer"}

### Perfil trabajador (registrar/iniciar sesión antes)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Trabajador de prueba","role":"Worker"}

### Catálogo público
GET {{base}}/api/v1/service-categories

### Domicilio
POST {{base}}/api/v1/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"label":"Casa","address":"Calle de prueba 123","city":"CDMX"}

### Solicitud: cambiar startsAt por una fecha entre 30 minutos y 6 meses en el futuro
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"locationId":"{{locationId}}","categoryId":"a1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","description":"Limpieza general de vivienda","startsAt":"2026-11-10T10:00:00-06:00","durationMinutes":120}

### Oportunidades para trabajador verificado
GET {{base}}/api/v1/requests?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}

### Cotizar: cambiar expiresAt por una fecha futura anterior al servicio
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":500.50,"notes":"Incluye insumos","expiresAt":"2026-11-09T10:00:00-06:00"}

### Consultar cotizaciones
GET {{base}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Aceptar
POST {{base}}/api/v1/quotes/{{quoteId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Reserva y domicilio privado
GET {{base}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}

### Checkout: elegir stripe O mercadopago antes de crear el primer pago
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"provider":"stripe"}

### Estado de pago, confirmado solo por webhook
GET {{base}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Mensaje persistente + evento SignalR
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Servicio confirmado; llego a la hora acordada."}

### Historial
GET {{base}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/messages?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Iniciar servicio (requiere pago confirmado)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"InProgress"}

### Cliente confirma terminación
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Completed"}

### Notificaciones
GET {{base}}/api/v1/notifications?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Documentos de mi cuenta
GET {{base}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}

### Administración: perfiles pendientes de verificar
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/profiles?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Administración: documentos pendientes de revisar
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/documents?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Auditoría
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/audit?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
